::BeforeSupplyChainCh10

@trigger 	OnOverarhcing 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey Cap'. Got another hauler available for you.
{@Player}   Great. I could use some good news.
{@Quinn}    Well... it's fully automated.
{@Quinn}    And ...it's slow.
{@Player}   Of course it is.
{@Quinn}    Hey, another ship means fewer bottlenecks. Sometimes having an extra hauler matters more than having a fast one.
{@Player}   I'll take it.

//spreading hazards causing delays from more inspections
{@Quinn}    You'll need it. Frontier's stopping pirate ships along some of the routes now.
{@Player}   Callie's people?
{@Quinn}    Among others. Inspections are backing everybody up.
{@Player}   So more delays.
{@Quinn}    Yep. Keep an eye on your routes.


